00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:34.970
Here, I'll go to the store and get me some meat or something.

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:37.310
All right, Maul.

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:41.040
Bet I'd go to that pool hall.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.660
If you do, I'm coming down there and get you.

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:43.960
I'll be right back, Maul.

00:08:49.640 --> 00:08:51.280
Oh, Mother, it's beautiful.

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:53.200
I'm glad you like it, honey.

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:56.260
I love it.

00:08:56.280 --> 00:08:57.020
It's darling.

00:08:58.090 --> 00:09:00.000
You know, honeydew, I'm glad it's you.

