00:09:43.670 --> 00:09:48.350
Mother, don't let father go to sleep in the theater and ask him to wear his Sunday suit, won't you?

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:51.780
Honey, I don't ask your father anything.

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:53.160
I'll tell you.

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:26.450
the ball with the flowers, maybe. I'll go and see. I'll be right back to you. Good afternoon,

00:10:26.590 --> 00:10:29.410
madam. Good afternoon. Uh...

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:31.060
